{"canonicalReference": "1.1", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "f1254e63eb5762c8071b458bf1ccc621f3f2161c9538582b75b391afb7f1ddda", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.1-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "ॐ\nश्रीपरमात्मने नमः\nअथ श्रीमद्भगवद्गीता\nप्रथमोऽध्यायः\n\nधृतराष्ट्र उवाच\nधर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता युयुत्सवः । \nमामकाः पाण्डवाश्चैव किमकुर्वत संजय  ॥१-१॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.1-verification-v1": "9c9eb2bde140255a76d827480ba91a460833abe30038455aed8f83fda0b42cc5", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.1-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 1}
{"canonicalReference": "1.2", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "40bfa3e40edfe609cc084cb6019316132a439cb8c49d11885d86e2ec479bd95a", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.2-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "सञ्जय उवाच\nदृष्ट्वा तु पाण्डवानीकं व्यूढं दुर्योधनस्तदा ।\nआचार्यमुपसंगम्य राजा वचनमब्रवीत्  ॥१-२॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.2-verification-v1": "9d306c2829e66ac8069e0e7a92169a86eb048c4061c48c392b9d3b26e77da0cc", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.2-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 2}
{"canonicalReference": "1.3", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "3a04438895338ad7b79cb39356c47307768776dbc62df5dbc0332a54f4693e53", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.3-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "पश्यैतां पाण्डुपुत्राणामाचार्य महतीं चमूम् ।\nव्यूढां द्रुपदपुत्रेण तव शिष्येण धीमता ॥१-३॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.3-verification-v1": "e8437b21be38c18762922aa8a3767b09ad0d442c9664dd6e1852c1bf58eaa41f", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.3-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 3}
{"canonicalReference": "1.4", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "6c9b57f86a1fa55664a52d1c9e2b26ceaca2ed97b012401f760f015e652d2fb9", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.4-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अत्र शूरा महेष्वासा भीमार्जुनसमा युधि ।\nयुयुधानो विराटश्च द्रुपदश्च महारथः ॥१-४॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.4-verification-v1": "a078f1e9cfe3b64081867abcb6e6c76aaf417b73696e8076356d469f99f34e13", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.4-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 4}
{"canonicalReference": "1.5", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "1674c6bc764213a1a171c11a9fcbf9575f55883da608d7d8218005a6d6cbf804", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.5-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "धृष्टकेतुश्चेकितानः काशिराजश्च वीर्यवान् ।\nपुरुजित्कुन्तिभोजश्च शैब्यश्च नरपुङ्गवः ॥१-५॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.5-verification-v1": "470905a282abcaf8f16b8b1ffdeec9c62b3642da356a7322d17ab677586b4fe0", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.5-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 5}
{"canonicalReference": "1.6", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "f8ee153ccc877b01861a0efcb013bcac047b88e6e18b09e8baeab151c366b017", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.6-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "युधामन्युश्च विक्रान्त उत्तमौजाश्च वीर्यवान् ।\nसौभद्रो द्रौपदेयाश्च सर्व एव महारथाः  ॥१-६॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.6-verification-v1": "7808ecea403c226f20101f493398cdf5c973b9b3383b4618f9f528d484355b7c", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.6-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 6}
{"canonicalReference": "1.7", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "fc7a550f4ee7b096fe81a0d8f4093e83ac51bec994441d37aab409da3b753ff6", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.7-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अस्माकं तु विशिष्टा ये तान्निबोध द्विजोत्तम ।\nनायका मम सैन्यस्य संज्ञार्थं तान्ब्रवीमि ते  ॥१-७॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.7-verification-v1": "6238f56f28fd0c5a647b215d63e6f32331b096f562acf3c611c6b9c2bc7876a3", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.7-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 7}
{"canonicalReference": "1.8", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "6d856c9273d6f40bf8ba1a0f7be2c10c58572d5ebdd18b7ca51ea6d271378959", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.8-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "भवान्भीष्मश्च कर्णश्च कृपश्च समितिंजयः ।\nअश्वत्थामा विकर्णश्च सौमदत्तिस्तथैव च  ॥१-८॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.8-verification-v1": "20b39088d5c179f827fca67039dd8ee1234d2a77a8fb5540043ab121eedd48ba", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.8-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 8}
{"canonicalReference": "1.9", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "c794ebc0876a9ca38ce4b00000106cab3d7370673267a7092e4fe8578506acef", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.9-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अन्ये च बहवः शूरा मदर्थे त्यक्तजीविताः ।\nनानाशस्त्रप्रहरणाः सर्वे युद्धविशारदाः  ॥१-९॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.9-verification-v1": "581923956fe6296fe70d226b2a092cc5cc892fcd183e0b375b03d71a03e35f2a", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.9-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 9}
{"canonicalReference": "1.10", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "6fd1dbd8f853db2b3347d550aeb5a349167fa42af7e9129d23acadf25aec4f73", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.10-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अपर्याप्तं तदस्माकं बलं भीष्माभिरक्षितम् ।\nपर्याप्तं त्विदमेतेषां बलं भीमाभिरक्षितम्  ॥१-१०॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.10-verification-v1": "971d965f7b29f47541d6988a7c53fc3b5a99e03037cca0f41d2ba94e7798ced3", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.10-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 10}
{"canonicalReference": "1.11", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "c7498fa9a15132694ffec4a99e8a6593d851ca9e9a13110685708646cba8f70a", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.11-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अयनेषु च सर्वेषु यथाभागमवस्थिताः ।\nभीष्ममेवाभिरक्षन्तु भवन्तः सर्व एव हि  ॥१-११॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.11-verification-v1": "e84d7fe56936e00271de340a298456b99d56b8bf9a527a9f2b60208dcac99f82", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.11-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 11}
{"canonicalReference": "1.12", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "ba2ef56ed773fbcb32e5e26bbe0c3ca9c3e720c7c2e959169d34ed2e343743a2", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.12-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "तस्य संजनयन्हर्षं कुरुवृद्धः पितामहः ।\nसिंहनादं विनद्योच्चैः शङ्खं दध्मौ प्रतापवान्  ॥१-१२॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.12-verification-v1": "e95cda4778f5d22cf23d9d74b9cda1418b81368a365e19187832a20db75ec970", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.12-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 12}
{"canonicalReference": "1.13", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "5bd5a9d4df9bbcf9bcb87f400326354ffe9c30b6973a904371035cf8117c5427", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.13-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "ततः शङ्खाश्च भेर्यश्च पणवानकगोमुखाः ।\nसहसैवाभ्यहन्यन्त स शब्दस्तुमुलोऽभवत्  ॥१-१३॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.13-verification-v1": "d21a648a468d5627256032df10a57d4c1ff27e65b433ab521283ebce50395536", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.13-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 13}
{"canonicalReference": "1.14", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "0d9c3a790103cab5c00ddff3b81aae84c4de0c752c8e5c672b38eef3bcfd7f14", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.14-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "ततः श्वेतैर्हयैर्युक्ते महति स्यन्दने स्थितौ ।\nमाधवः पाण्डवश्चैव दिव्यौ शङ्खौ प्रदध्मतुः  ॥१-१४॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.14-verification-v1": "70be8cd033b8879617218216675c16862347fceffd2a23da5fcbad42f3fc7563", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.14-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 14}
{"canonicalReference": "1.15", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "c6cc02b93b4679de83aba132cdc71f26ecd72c9bf32fd6cca4e4369ca0ae78c4", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.15-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "पाञ्चजन्यं हृषीकेशो देवदत्तं धनञ्जयः ।\nपौण्ड्रं दध्मौ महाशङ्खं भीमकर्मा वृकोदरः  ॥१-१५॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.15-verification-v1": "44acf3a6d8e8d9a786bc1704ff1cd0e9314f80d80857dcdec7132fbc492e2088", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.15-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 15}
{"canonicalReference": "1.16", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "c7af6f1f87c677eaea9ea1ff612932f14f2bcff9361bcab1891856dbdc5c8379", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.16-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अनन्तविजयं राजा कुन्तीपुत्रो युधिष्ठिरः ।\nनकुलः सहदेवश्च सुघोषमणिपुष्पकौ  ॥१-१६॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.16-verification-v1": "231f8997342e6283b614af85655639bff2f5e1537598df6801a54ff2b041325c", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.16-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 16}
{"canonicalReference": "1.17", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "37350dfb1ed104366894eaf604855ab173732d284bc5ab60a21a3f6cae847eca", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.17-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "काश्यश्च परमेष्वासः शिखण्डी च महारथः ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नो विराटश्च सात्यकिश्चापराजितः  ॥१-१७॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.17-verification-v1": "c044763b9a0da3c5771ae46d90ba5ea57af53ddddd36e6e8dcdff9ec99833139", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.17-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 17}
{"canonicalReference": "1.18", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "fe4dd594ad3550d9cabf792c2c77c1dad3f0b825de669373ab06c7a012108102", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.18-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "द्रुपदो द्रौपदेयाश्च सर्वशः पृथिवीपते ।\nसौभद्रश्च महाबाहुः शङ्खान्दध्मुः पृथक्पृथक्  ॥१-१८॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.18-verification-v1": "989a0cdd8d240495a0bd37a7d0329300d8e961bb10baaf8bca1aa41dd3335e86", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.18-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 18}
{"canonicalReference": "1.19", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "028032e3514dda42b1ecb737e72b02ffdb12e3a5f6c0422ebf2cf066913c0467", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.19-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "स घोषो धार्तराष्ट्राणां हृदयानि व्यदारयत् ।\nनभश्च पृथिवीं चैव तुमुलो व्यनुनादयन्  ॥१-१९॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.19-verification-v1": "f1bd007c8c3bafb37fb456e46b7c056d44bda70044a4389a8a2d14879017cba9", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.19-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 19}
{"canonicalReference": "1.20", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "ab4360c4845a79277a9769029ed4046f62201fe5dfde3f1e6d969d31faff922f", "editorialDecisionId": "final-conflict-ch01-1.20-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अथ व्यवस्थितान्दृष्ट्वा धार्तराष्ट्रान्कपिध्वजः ।\nप्रवृत्ते शस्त्रसंपाते धनुरुद्यम्य पाण्डवः  ॥१-२०॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.20-verification-v1": "f9b5e6695eb056ae5eb3a0f65a64955fa72fe4d0a812061b6c279ab620b2ac97", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-sanskritdocuments-bhagvadnew-verse-1.20-verification-v1": "7b4ed199c06027a36205d6dce9d69fadaa2f8c32b72404f7ebb4fb80094b97a0", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.20-verification-v1", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-sanskritdocuments-bhagvadnew-verse-1.20-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 20}
{"canonicalReference": "1.21", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "da0a224df86ebd5673710b0ed0d9693886225f8c973f780c5f31ff27a1d19818", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.21-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अर्जुन उवाच\nहृषीकेशं तदा वाक्यमिदमाह महीपते ।\nसेनयोरुभयोर्मध्ये रथं स्थापय मेऽच्युत  ॥१-२१॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.21-verification-v1": "f191edd01581c4f62cc3b42bb3c60a97792cf3cbe7dee2ad59727f91ed48f486", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.21-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 21}
{"canonicalReference": "1.22", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "0f9a8ceef48ab7cc5ad20cf214483bcca88d9b33a25083df468835e2fac6f79e", "editorialDecisionId": "final-conflict-ch01-1.22-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "यावदेतान्निरिक्षेऽहं योद्‌धुकामानवस्थितान् ।\nकैर्मया सह योद्धव्यमस्मिन् रणसमुद्यमे  ॥१-२२॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.22-verification-v1": "fbfcfc8103c8ec48792e0d04a73c2dea503da5ed4655de1dc3e3e3ddefaadf37", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-sanskritdocuments-bhagvadnew-verse-1.22-verification-v1": "68a6608b87ad2bb9121e78eeb1899c5b83a1e2490ec1280e601fbc2058d09f09", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.22-verification-v1", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-sanskritdocuments-bhagvadnew-verse-1.22-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 22}
{"canonicalReference": "1.23", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "65d8c1724b5c95a4f8c6bfab21bf3328bd3794520b812a7600008af06f0a6f79", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.23-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "योत्स्यमानानवेक्षेऽहं य एतेऽत्र समागताः ।\nधार्तराष्ट्रस्य दुर्बुद्धेर्युद्धे प्रियचिकीर्षवः  ॥१-२३॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.23-verification-v1": "a4187b774579b2921b692e232cdec090257aa52188a4f73849df27b55d0879cf", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.23-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 23}
{"canonicalReference": "1.24", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "ce8546aa989085661fed3e29f04f0159a8f97544abe6b3dd0ec1e0dfaa5c9a92", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.24-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "सञ्जय उवाच\nएवमुक्तो हृषीकेशो गुडाकेशेन भारत ।\nसेनयोरुभयोर्मध्ये स्थापयित्वा रथोत्तमम्  ॥१-२४॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.24-verification-v1": "c2c90d53dad940f05bfd135f4e201644606216b7b28b44930f3f7c1f349b36de", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.24-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 24}
{"canonicalReference": "1.25", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "e5cd41922924981dee93b8e61944a98e01b93566b4aa70729bb2ae3a5138072a", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.25-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "भीष्मद्रोणप्रमुखतः सर्वेषां च महीक्षिताम् ।\nउवाच पार्थ पश्यैतान्समवेतान्कुरूनिति  ॥१-२५॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.25-verification-v1": "88036022acb833a2e7855195c2f12bc2315c849e5f0e79377f0dfaa78b401840", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.25-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 25}
{"canonicalReference": "1.26", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "df6794ee5b3fc433a4fb293258a02b9dbfaf2a69802b5fb1f10d97a9a97c792d", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.26-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "तत्रापश्यत्स्थितान्पार्थः पितॄनथ पितामहान् ।\nआचार्यान्मातुलान्भ्रातॄन्पुत्रान्पौत्रान्सखींस्तथा  ॥१-२६॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.26-verification-v1": "0ba414c99459903bd89920a3732e945a37389a1fad66793e2ceb53963e6c0f7a", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.26-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 26}
{"canonicalReference": "1.27", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "9ffcbd8efc7ff8c054fce6354620dbe8d1765764077962688f1777817561b746", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.27-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "श्वशुरान्सुहृदश्चैव सेनयोरुभयोरपि ।\nतान्समीक्ष्य स कौन्तेयः सर्वान्बन्धूनवस्थितान्  ॥१-२७॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.27-verification-v1": "06480547e03349a5590bbf860162c3bad967e6f08617ef3bef2957ebce1e3940", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.27-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 27}
{"canonicalReference": "1.28", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "31039a3608773d90bc6ad2b9cdc4adba4b08b723b8223413bb9b72e5ba0abaa3", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.28-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अर्जुन उवाच\nकृपया परयाविष्टो विषीदन्निदमब्रवीत् ।\nदृष्ट्वेमं स्वजनं कृष्ण युयुत्सुं समुपस्थितम्  ॥१-२८॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.28-verification-v1": "9e2bf62a82b7009835853a3d4a7c14fabed71e73caa121e20ce82c4736b7de77", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.28-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 28}
{"canonicalReference": "1.29", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "7321eba4d5073a6de3b27a5d0ae3b0f85e5f12291950bd00939e959479687121", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.29-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "सीदन्ति मम गात्राणि मुखं च परिशुष्यति ।\nवेपथुश्च शरीरे मे रोमहर्षश्च जायते  ॥१-२९॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.29-verification-v1": "fea757e78f940c840721a9743a865967fc47450172501f8bd74f6140b7ed74f3", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.29-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 29}
{"canonicalReference": "1.30", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "5fde866e40721f89165ddd13a73b5e554e9615bdb519a40077eee5a88fe82495", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.30-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "गाण्डीवं स्रंसते हस्तात्त्वक्चैव परिदह्यते ।\nन च शक्नोम्यवस्थातुं भ्रमतीव च मे मनः  ॥१-३०॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.30-verification-v1": "2be4d23c5edc480bb847fc6321d8052d0180d7b144e35222b3354571df098d4a", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.30-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 30}
{"canonicalReference": "1.31", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "358f0b2a88d7485a8bf8f11c306cb5958cdc58e690d765b33b1ef479e49621e0", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.31-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "निमित्तानि च पश्यामि विपरीतानि केशव ।\nन च श्रेयोऽनुपश्यामि हत्वा स्वजनमाहवे  ॥१-३१॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.31-verification-v1": "61de282c3f061fcf10544a769a1af1d916256291165fb3e1f2b19b5b981e44e2", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.31-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 31}
{"canonicalReference": "1.32", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "d41c4dc1362c726a7e6093f6cc76a71cb1358d94b23257048ad32520f49d5cf8", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.32-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "न काङ्क्षे विजयं कृष्ण न च राज्यं सुखानि च ।\nकिं नो राज्येन गोविन्द किं भोगैर्जीवितेन वा  ॥१-३२॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.32-verification-v1": "0e2ed60a3c8fe0ecb19315377f62c3af04fc4c50a65f7ee30b4725ec5f3844d4", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.32-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 32}
{"canonicalReference": "1.33", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "97798301e4596688764213714b77a3b450c4ceb1298372ee54cf5bb602802bb5", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.33-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "येषामर्थे काङ्क्षितं नो राज्यं भोगाः सुखानि च ।\nत इमेऽवस्थिता युद्धे प्राणांस्त्यक्त्वा धनानि च  ॥१-३३॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.33-verification-v1": "c06e1e747635263f091e50d8c63fd8e35626d3bba60855c51565aa8737413a03", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.33-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 33}
{"canonicalReference": "1.34", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "0190740300ef92ab2dd24970e6d15220cce1d1978a3988ab4b3fb0cada78654b", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.34-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "आचार्याः पितरः पुत्रास्तथैव च पितामहाः ।\nमातुलाः श्वशुराः पौत्राः श्यालाः संबन्धिनस्तथा  ॥१-३४॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.34-verification-v1": "dfbbcf1af132bdae6f54c475d52e8c1eeba0aaaeb6d0f281c20da8fefb52a8cf", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.34-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 34}
{"canonicalReference": "1.35", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "232ef6fcb9e9582e962e51c3422fb5360feb7448d2cb78c98ed0a5d5559e46bb", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.35-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "एतान्न हन्तुमिच्छामि घ्नतोऽपि मधुसूदन ।\nअपि त्रैलोक्यराज्यस्य हेतोः किं नु महीकृते  ॥१-३५॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.35-verification-v1": "ce0efffad3b56f9246df06502e7ef7134aba4fae2c029ad19e1a7ae2708ad860", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.35-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 35}
{"canonicalReference": "1.36", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "bbdad1acf5ca13ee260d2f7ff288370d8a7dc739bf1158ed3dcfa525ae64155a", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.36-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "निहत्य धार्तराष्ट्रान्नः का प्रीतिः स्याज्जनार्दन ।\nपापमेवाश्रयेदस्मान्हत्वैतानाततायिनः  ॥१-३६॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.36-verification-v1": "23d88af28d55a71612087b85e917c7434cfd4cb0b26ea50554366748fa77cd4e", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.36-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 36}
{"canonicalReference": "1.37", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "4e7abf13ebc1b21b1834c9df63ff9230220d3ba4b3cd25eeddd270a9277572a5", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.37-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "तस्मान्नार्हा वयं हन्तुं धार्तराष्ट्रान्स्वबान्धवान् ।\nस्वजनं हि कथं हत्वा सुखिनः स्याम माधव  ॥१-३७॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.37-verification-v1": "d51cd5e92a7109fd1ecf7283f0a96acf1038921eba1008d6aa98613dee2e9805", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.37-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 37}
{"canonicalReference": "1.38", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "ffd36ec05e6504880f2d951d81f5a348ad13c8ee4a7d5e50221b6b891a0a666a", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.38-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "यद्यप्येते न पश्यन्ति लोभोपहतचेतसः ।\nकुलक्षयकृतं दोषं मित्रद्रोहे च पातकम्  ॥१-३८॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.38-verification-v1": "6f0b37c6882e6c10401852a8afb8ae40f0ebab9c333e046cef7f31707390a2b4", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.38-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 38}
{"canonicalReference": "1.39", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "14f36ff2877d2340b2a3d432f347dd7c90dcf949b6cbbf4dd89cf24cb8224db7", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.39-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "कथं न ज्ञेयमस्माभिः पापादस्मान्निवर्तितुम् ।\nकुलक्षयकृतं दोषं प्रपश्यद्भिर्जनार्दन  ॥१-३९॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.39-verification-v1": "dd3b54e52732dcc79d095688c9a94570e45d266a996f48a8e5784bd4e9b7b887", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.39-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 39}
{"canonicalReference": "1.40", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "2fb71d7ffce18d07a064472ba4c26affb8e32e79cdea1dbb1cdf99cbac06e567", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.40-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "कुलक्षये प्रणश्यन्ति कुलधर्माः सनातनाः ।\nधर्मे नष्टे कुलं कृत्स्नमधर्मोऽभिभवत्युत  ॥१-४०॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.40-verification-v1": "d5403583f5911e5f2543d6f06cdc1123d3deca7b1ed7d993faa0f685921cc118", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.40-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 40}
{"canonicalReference": "1.41", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "18985ad9eee7b4b9eaf4dcfa6d5c044a0d1ef78f6e4549302a2eaf74237eb76a", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.41-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अधर्माभिभवात्कृष्ण प्रदुष्यन्ति कुलस्त्रियः ।\nस्त्रीषु दुष्टासु वार्ष्णेय जायते वर्णसंकरः  ॥१-४१॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.41-verification-v1": "98627a022f44835fafa0535394311fa0e5593d1b9dc6178fdd39d8d773ad208d", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.41-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 41}
{"canonicalReference": "1.42", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "d572e5de6d70a497c1f7dd03311b2217ad8da02bea1ac28c80dc5fbea6e9005c", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.42-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "संकरो नरकायैव कुलघ्नानां कुलस्य च ।\nपतन्ति पितरो ह्येषां लुप्तपिण्डोदकक्रियाः  ॥१-४२॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.42-verification-v1": "d53e7d1aa9e41f2f5cb6e51e627fe6e8831ed2cb5ca2021357aa7e9d3eece1d3", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.42-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 42}
{"canonicalReference": "1.43", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "910c5fe8c6f45f0ee1bbf63a3b4d2e94228b93ed80211c04ff4400fba87acdbe", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.43-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "दोषैरेतैः कुलघ्नानां वर्णसंकरकारकैः ।\nउत्साद्यन्ते जातिधर्माः कुलधर्माश्च शाश्वताः  ॥१-४३॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.43-verification-v1": "f377ef1cfd32f9e538ae6915d60072a6eca6719b74bf5d96a4e486c3936a34e0", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.43-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 43}
{"canonicalReference": "1.44", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "da5373c13cdd1c380031c5aceaf74a9a9e0a5309901aaf4af9a39176dbf3ac1b", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.44-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "उत्सन्नकुलधर्माणां मनुष्याणां जनार्दन ।\nनरकेऽनियतं वासो भवतीत्यनुशुश्रुम  ॥१-४४॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.44-verification-v1": "7647d235ee1e199e2873c2c9ebb2212e35f57fefdc0594226d8d3097e6854884", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.44-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 44}
{"canonicalReference": "1.45", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "94e3ec0293586d069b666e4653706e5072152b33c60117b86fb8e26171628acd", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.45-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "अहो बत महत्पापं कर्तुं व्यवसिता वयम् ।\nयद्राज्यसुखलोभेन हन्तुं स्वजनमुद्यताः  ॥१-४५॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.45-verification-v1": "f1d6ad59a615c9d17d16bc0aac77584e51cd7579798ed97fe1b4413b091b6090", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.45-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 45}
{"canonicalReference": "1.46", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "b20bc183a0761a72c56c3bd5104795b355253d936670d3ff4273f97d8e1779fa", "editorialDecisionId": "batch-norm-match-ch01-1.46-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "यदि मामप्रतीकारमशस्त्रं शस्त्रपाणयः ।\nधार्तराष्ट्रा रणे हन्युस्तन्मे क्षेमतरं भवेत्  ॥१-४६॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.46-verification-v1": "98772aa52b35611207b6c7cea66892293c447b7162cb5f185c1d5480ac6c636b", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.46-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 46}
{"canonicalReference": "1.47", "chapterNumber": 1, "contentVersion": 1, "editorialApprovalChecksum": "b1da66058377940aa2320c3a08b9cc6a3d2a9a57e20d9313e44b8f4e5586d1af", "editorialDecisionId": "ortho-resolve-ch01-1.47-2026-08-04", "sanskritText": "सञ्जय उवाच\nएवमुक्त्वार्जुनः संख्ये रथोपस्थ उपाविशत् ।\nविसृज्य सशरं चापं शोकसंविग्नमानसः  ॥१-४७॥", "sourceChecksums": {"bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.47-verification-v1": "89e01fd1bb1b0498ef57986d7f61e0c8af2fd42985caa77eb4516f79b31c58ea", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151": "b2df3556998a3a18dd3fe12269d491887a21bc8791cb1b918cd226aff75b8321"}, "sourceIds": ["bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-wikisource-sa-chapter-01-r343151", "bhagavad-gita-sanskrit-iitk-verse-1.47-verification-v1"], "transliteration": null, "verseNumber": 47}
